Model (not included)
--------------------
No model weights are included or downloaded by the nodes. tools/download_model.py fetches, when you run it:
- cloud0day3/antalia-mini (Apache-2.0): config.json, the acoustic and vocoder safetensors (fp32 and fp16), LICENSE, NOTICE,
  README.md. According to its NOTICE, the weights were trained on synthetic speech generated with VoxCPM2 (OpenBMB,
  Apache-2.0); the voice is synthetic, not a real person's.
